OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 25 JAN
OL,4,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,5,     GJoin Sarah Walker for three hours
OL,6,     Gof classical music to reflect,
OL,7,     Grestore and refresh, including a
OL,8,     Gcalming Choral Reflection at
OL,9,     G9.45, and another specially
OL,10,     Gchosen Sunday Sequence.
OL,11,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,12,     GMichael Berkeley's guest is the
OL,13,     Gstage and screen actor Paul
OL,14,     GChahidi, whose musical passions
OL,15,     Ginclude Beethoven, Vaughan
OL,16,     GWilliams, Persian folk music and
OL,17,     GSondheim.
