OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 25 JAN
OL,4,G1330FMusic Map
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch charts a course
OL,6,     Gto The Young Person's Guide to
OL,7,     Gthe Orchestra by Britten,
OL,8,     Gfeaturing composers inspired by
OL,9,     Gthe past, or exploring different
OL,10,     Gsections of an orchestra.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GLive from St Paul's Cathedral,
OL,13,     Gwith music by Judith Bingham,
OL,14,     GWalmisley, Wood and Parry.
OL,15,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,16,     GAlyn Shipton has saxophones to
OL,17,     Gthe fore with Bobby Wellins,
OL,18,     GHarry Allen and Serge Chaloff.
OL,19,     GPlus we hear from jazz vocalists
OL,20,     GAnna Pancaldi, Cyrille Aimee and
OL,21,     GPeg LaCentra.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
