OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 25 JAN
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French explores a new set
OL,6,     Gof Brandenburg Concertos, based
OL,7,     Gon JS Bach's organ trios, which
OL,8,     Ghave been recently recorded by
OL,9,     GConcerto Copenhagen.
OL,10,G1800FWords and Music
OL,11,     GA celebration of the reign of
OL,12,     GQueen Victoria with prose, poetry
OL,13,     Gand music from writers and
OL,14,     Gcomposers of the era, including
OL,15,     Gwords from Victoria and music
OL,16,     Gfrom Prince Albert.
OL,17,G1915FBetween the Ears: On Rama's Bridge
OL,18,     GNandini Das reflects upon memory,
OL,19,     Gdisplacement and myth at the
OL,20,     Gextreme points of India and Sri
OL,21,     GLanka, where the two nations
OL,22,     Gnearly touch.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
